# HAB fuse template for i.MX6ULL
# Format: H:<type>:<bank>:<word>:<value>
#   H = Header
#   T = Type (HAB)
#   F = Fuse line (bank:word to program)
#   C = Close command (bank:word:value)
#
# References:
#   i.MX6ULL Reference Manual - Fusemap chapter
#   i.MX6ULL Security Reference Manual - HAB section
#
# SRK hash fuses occupy 8 consecutive words in bank 3:
#   Bank 3, Word 0-7: SRK_HASH[255:0]
#
# Close command: Bank 0, Word 6, bit 0 (SEC_CONFIG[0] = Closed)

H:T:HAB
H:F:3:0:
H:F:3:1:
H:F:3:2:
H:F:3:3:
H:F:3:4:
H:F:3:5:
H:F:3:6:
H:F:3:7:
H:C:0:6:0x00000002
